                        1539 --677: /**
                        1540 --678:  * Part of the R_FDL_Handler function.
                        1541 --679:  * Get and judge Flash operation result (not fatal errors, just operation results) and
                        1542 --680:  * do further suspend processing in case of pending suspend request or already suspended
